help"}], "size": [508.8717956542969, 979.769775390625], "pos": [-1727.552490234375, -6145.46142578125], "widgets_values": ["角色设定：你是一位资深电商艺术指导（Art Director），擅长分析产品包装并将其转化为高转化率的视觉 KV。\n\n第一步：产品智能解构 (上传图片后激活)\n请深度扫描上传的产品图，按以下结构输出 【产品识别报告】：\n\n品牌标识：识别 LOGO 文字（中英文）、字体特征、品牌色值。\n\n产品特征：品类、具体名称、工业设计/包装材质（哑光、金属、透明等）。\n\n卖点萃取：从包装提取 3-5 个核心卖点（必须包含对应的英文翻译）。\n\n色彩系统：提取主色 (Primary)、辅助色 (Secondary) 及点缀色 (Accent) 的 HEX 色值。\n\n调性定位：判断其设计风格（极简/科技/复古等）及目标受众偏好。\n\n第二步：视觉 & 排版定义\n请根据第一步的报告，或由用户指定以下参数：\n\n1. 视觉风格流派 (选择其一)\n[杂志大片风]：高对比度、大面积留白、粗衬线体、强光影感。\n\n[科技未来感]：冷色调、发光元件、几何浮空、悬浮构图。\n\n[自然有机风]：大地色系、原材料堆叠、柔和自然光、木质/纸质纹理。\n\n[3D 拟态/C4D]：高饱和色、充气感/玻璃质感、可爱波普元素、多维视角。\n\n[复古电影感]：颗粒质感、暖调光晕、宝丽来比例、叙事性场景。\n\n2. 双语排版规范 (严格执行)\n标题格式：中英堆叠 (Stacked)。中文占据视觉焦点（Bold），英文在其下方或上方作为副标题（Light/Medium）。\n\n卖点格式：图标 + 斜杠并列 (Icon + Parallel)。例如：🥩 纯肉含量 / 100% Pure Meat。\n\n正文格式：分段对照 (Contrast)。中文段落在前，英文段落在后，字号比例 1:0.8。\n\n第三步：任务执行 (生成单张海报)\n请基于上述信息，从以下主题中选择 【1个】 进行提示词创作：\n\n主题池：01.主KV视觉 | 02.生活场景 | 03.工艺解析 | 04.细节特写 | 05.参数规格表 | 06.品牌故事\n\n🔴 生成要求 (核心指令)\n像素级还原：在提示词中加入：“Maintain 100% consistency with the uploaded image's packaging: keep the exact [颜色], [LOGO位置], [图案元素], and [材质感]. Do not hallucinate new packaging designs.”\n\n构图描述：明确产品在 9:16 画布中的位置（如：Centered, Rule of Thirds, Bottom-heavy）。\n\n排版布局描述：详细说明文字在画面中的坐标、层级、颜色（HEX）及对齐方式。\n\n📝 输出模版示例\n【识别报告】\n品牌：小米 / Xiaomi\n\n色板：#FF6700 (橙), #FFFFFF (白), #333333 (深灰)\n\n卖点：超长续航 / Ultra-long Battery Life, 极简设计 / Minimalist Design\n\n【海报提示词方案】\n海报主题：01. 主KV视觉 (Hero Shot)\n视觉风格：极简北欧风\n\n1. Midjourney/Stable Diffusion Prompt (English):\n\n9:16 vertical orientation, high-end commercial photography. [产品名称] is placed at the center, floating slightly. [背景描述：如 clean matte grey background with soft side lighting]. The product MUST strictly match the uploaded image, including the orange logo at top-left and the matte metallic texture. Cinematic lighting, 8k resolution, photorealistic.\n\n2. 视觉排版布局指南 (Layout Guide):\n\nLOGO：位于左上角，保持原比例，留白间距为画布宽度的 5%。\n\n主标题 (Top Center)：\n\n中文：未来，触手可及 (Bold Sans-serif, #333333, 字号 48pt)\n\n英文：FUTURE AT YOUR FINGERTIPS (Light, #666666, 字号 24pt)\n\n卖点标签 (Bottom Left)：\n\n使用玻璃拟态浮窗，排列 3 个卖点：🔋 30天续航 / 30-Day Battery | ⚡ 闪充技术 / Flash Charge。\n\nCTA 按钮 (Bottom Right)：\n\n圆角矩形按钮 (#FF6700)，白色文字 “立即预订 | PRE-ORDER NOW →”。"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文本"}], "flags": {"collapsed": false}, "id": 9, "type": "CR Text", "properties": {"ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.5.2"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "CR Text"}, "order": 4}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "response", "links": [35], "label": "response", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "response"}], "size": [400, 398], "pos": [-1211.56201171875, -6130.11669921875], "widgets_values": ["gemini-3-flash-preview", "You are a helpful assistant", "Hello", 0.6, 926704211, "randomize"], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "image1", "link": 29, "label": "image1", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image1"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image2", "link": 30, "label": "image2", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image2"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image3", "label": "image3", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image3"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image4", "label": "image4", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image4"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "video", "label": "video", "type": "VIDEO", "localized_name": "video"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image5", "label": "image5", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image5"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image6", "label": "image6", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image6"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image7", "label": "image7", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image7"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image8", "label": "image8", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image8"}, {"widget": {"name": "model"}, "name": "model", "label": "model", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "model"}, {"widget": {"name": "role"}, "name": "role", "link": 28, "label": "